        "Description": "Price: We obtained the records about Fregata from the bank. It&apos;s shadow owner is Guido Lori, he was also the chief chemist and the bomb maker of Hannan. He was behind the attacks on the European countries. He currently set up lab in Italy. 47, you will go there and take him out, and also Hannan&apos;s two close allies and operatives. I will take a look around Lori&apos;s computer system to find out where Hannan might be keeping the Russian President hostage. We cannot let him get the launch codes.",
